<title>USA: Gibson Cty Redev Auth, Ind., won by Edward Jones.</title>
<headline>Gibson Cty Redev Auth, Ind., won by Edward Jones.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Edward Jones said it won $3.7 million of Gibson County Redevelopment Authority, Ind., economic development lease rental revenue bonds of 1997, Series B, with a net interest cost of 5.15 percent.</p>
</text>
